                                                "sense_id": "c25ef43a-93b4-31df-8452-c4f9b343724b",
                                                "text": "Sir Terence, who has been complimentary about the food throughout the meal, suddenly erupts: \"Oh, not grapes on the cheeseboard! I've always thought grapes with cheese is deeply suburban."
